@startuml
!theme plain
left to right direction
title File-backed login layout: shared and isolated
folder "Native home" {
  file "Native credential file\n(tool-owned)" as Native
}
folder "Managed home: shared" {
  file "Declared credential path\n(symlink)" as Shared
}
folder "Managed home: isolated" {
  file "Own credential file\n(tool-owned login)" as Isolated
}
Shared --> Native : verified link
note bottom of Isolated
  No link to native credentials.
  macOS Claude instead uses its
  per-home Keychain identity
  or session-qualified file fallback.
end note
note bottom of Shared
  Current defaults: see environment-config.md.
  Muse file admission changes in rc.7.
  macOS Claude shared is refused.
end note
@enduml
